    {
      "id": "p0113-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In modern Japanese entertainment, oira can still be used to lend characters a rural, unsophisticated vibe, but oira is more commonly associated with lovable rascals, rambunctious pranksters, and friendly mascots. Other fictional characters who use oira include:",
        "raw": "In modern Japanese entertainment, oira can still be used to lend\ncharacters a rural, unsophisticated vibe, but oira is more commonly\nassociated with lovable rascals, rambunctious pranksters, and friendly\nmascots. Other fictional characters who use oira include:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.11916691,
